{"ref":"BDB, אֲבִימָאֵל","hw":"אֲבִימָאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִימָאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>a father is Ēl;</em> South-Arabic name<strong>)</strong> son of Joktan <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:28\" href=\"/Genesis.10.28\">Gn 10:28</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.22\">1 Ch 1:22</a>. Cf. Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">אבמעתֿתר</span>, <em>Abmi ʿAṯtar</em> a father is <em>ʿAṯtar</em> ([<span dir=\"rtl\">עשׁתר</span>] v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עַשְׁתֹּ֫רֶת\" href=\"/BDB,_עַשְׁתֹּ֫רֶת\", dir=\"rtl\">עַשְׁתֹּרֶת</a>) Hal<sup>M 86</sup>, DHM<sup>ZMG 1883, 18</sup>.","next":"BDB, אֲבִימֶ֫לֶךְ","prev":"BDB, אֲבִיטָ֑ל"}